      "text": "Use case\n- 3rd party vendor (aur kuch implement karna ho tab)\n- ek lagacy code hai(very old code) aur ek new code hai to un dono k syntax or methods me bahut changes ho gaye hai aur hume un dono ko baat karwani hai to hum udhar adapter use kar skte hai",
