      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Requirements:\n- We should be able to manage Inventory. (Add/Remove items)\n- We should have replenish strategies\n- We Can have multiple InventoryStore (like DBInventoryStore etc) & Can be further extended.\n- User should ablt to see items from all the Darkstores closer to him/her (5km)\n- If one darkstore cannot fulfil order, one order can be split into multiple DS, fulfilled by myltiple Delivery agetns.\n",
